---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PromptPage from "../../../components/PromptPage.astro";

const masterPrompt = `Act as an experienced food photographer, food stylist and AI image prompt engineer.

TASK:
Create a production-ready food photography prompt based on the details below.

DISH / FOOD:
[Describe the food or beverage.]

CUISINE / STYLE:
[Example: Sri Lankan, Italian, café-style, fine dining, homemade, street food.]

KEY FOOD DETAILS TO PRESERVE:
[Describe shape, colour, texture, ingredients, layers, garnish, portion size or other important characteristics.]

SERVING STYLE:
[Example: plated meal, bowl, tray, wooden board, cake stand, glass, takeaway packaging.]

SCENE / ENVIRONMENT:
[Example: home kitchen, rustic dining table, premium restaurant, café counter, studio setup.]

MOOD:
[Example: warm, comforting, premium, fresh, rustic, luxurious, bright.]

CAMERA ANGLE:
[Example: overhead, 45-degree angle, eye level, close-up, macro.]

FRAMING:
[Example: tight hero shot, medium composition, full table scene, negative space for text.]

LIGHTING:
[Example: soft window light, warm directional light, dramatic side light, premium studio lighting.]

BACKGROUND:
[Describe colour, material, props and environment.]

FOOD STYLING:
[Describe garnish, crumbs, sauce, utensils, napkins, steam, cut pieces or serving details.]

TEXTURE EMPHASIS:
[What should look especially appetizing? Example: crisp edges, glossy sauce, moist crumb, melted cheese.]

FRESHNESS CUES:
[Example: steam, condensation, shine, freshly cut surface, bubbling sauce.]

COLOUR DIRECTION:
[Describe the desired palette.]

DEPTH OF FIELD:
[Example: shallow depth of field, everything sharp, soft background blur.]

LENS / PHOTOGRAPHIC FEEL:
[Example: 50mm food photography, 85mm editorial look, macro close-up.]

ASPECT RATIO:
[Example: 4:5, 1:1, 9:16, 16:9.]

IMAGE PURPOSE:
[Example: Facebook post, Reel cover, menu image, website hero, advertisement, recipe article.]

TEXT / LOGO REQUIREMENTS:
[Specify whether text or branding is required, optional or should be avoided.]

REFERENCE REQUIREMENTS:
[If a reference image is used, explain what must remain visually consistent.]

NEGATIVE CONSTRAINTS:
[List anything that should not appear.]

RESPONSE REQUIREMENTS:

1. FOOD ACCURACY
- Preserve the real structure, colour, ingredients and texture of the dish.
- Do not add ingredients, garnish or decoration that were not requested.
- Do not change the number of layers, pieces or portions when these details are specified.

2. APPETIZING REALISM
- Make the food look naturally fresh and edible.
- Emphasize realistic texture, moisture, crispness, sauce, crumb or steam where relevant.
- Avoid plastic-looking, overly glossy or artificial food surfaces.

3. COMPOSITION
- Make the dish the clear visual hero.
- Use supporting props only when they improve the scene.
- Keep important elements inside the safe area for the requested format.

4. LIGHTING
- Use believable light direction and natural shadows.
- Avoid flat lighting unless specifically requested.

5. CAMERA
- Use the requested viewing angle and framing.
- Keep perspective physically believable.
- Avoid excessive wide-angle distortion.

6. FOOD STYLING
- Keep presentation attractive but realistic.
- Use natural imperfections where appropriate.
- Avoid excessive garnish or decorative clutter.

7. BACKGROUND
- Make the background support the food rather than compete with it.
- Maintain visual separation between the dish and surrounding elements.

8. REFERENCE CONSISTENCY
If a reference image is provided:
- preserve important food characteristics
- preserve plate, container or serving style when requested
- do not redesign the dish unnecessarily

9. TEXT
- Do not generate random text, labels, logos or watermarks.
- If text space is required, leave clean negative space instead of inventing typography.

10. IMAGE QUALITY
Aim for:
- photorealistic food detail
- realistic ingredients
- natural shadows
- controlled highlights
- accurate proportions
- believable depth of field
- premium commercial photography quality

OUTPUT FORMAT:

1. Final Food Photography Prompt
2. Composition & Camera
3. Lighting Direction
4. Food Styling
5. Texture & Freshness Details
6. Background & Props
7. Negative Constraints

The Final Food Photography Prompt should be written as one polished block that can be copied directly into an AI image-generation model.`;

const steps = [
  {
    title: "Describe the food precisely",
    description:
      "Mention the real shape, colour, layers, ingredients and texture so the model does not redesign the dish.",
  },
  {
    title: "Choose the camera angle",
    description:
      "Overhead, 45-degree and eye-level views create very different food images. Select the angle based on what you need to show.",
  },
  {
    title: "Control styling and props",
    description:
      "Specify only the garnish, utensils, plates and background elements you actually want in the final composition.",
  },
  {
    title: "Protect realism",
    description:
      "Use negative constraints to prevent fake textures, excessive garnish, distorted food, random text and unrealistic presentation.",
  },
];

const example = {
  input: [
    "Dish: Traditional Sri Lankan Pol Cake.",
    "Food details: Low rectangular coconut cake squares with a moist dark golden-brown crumb.",
    "Topping: Light kithul treacle glaze with visible coconut, chopped dates and cashew pieces.",
    "Scene: Warm wooden kitchen table.",
    "Camera: 45-degree close-up.",
    "Lighting: Soft warm side light.",
    "Purpose: Facebook recipe post.",
    "Aspect ratio: 4:5.",
  ],

  output: [
    "Create a photorealistic premium food photograph of traditional Sri Lankan Pol Cake arranged as several low rectangular cake squares on a simple ceramic serving plate.",
    "Preserve the dense moist golden-brown coconut crumb and realistic low cake height. Add only a light kithul treacle glaze with visible coconut, chopped dates and cashew pieces.",
    "Photograph from a close 45-degree angle using soft warm directional side lighting, natural shadows and shallow depth of field.",
    "Use a warm wooden tabletop and minimal neutral kitchen props in the softly blurred background. Keep the cake as the clear hero of the 4:5 composition.",
  ],
};

const tips = [
  {
    title: "Texture sells the food",
    description:
      "Describe what makes the dish appetizing: moist crumb, crisp crust, glossy sauce, flaky pastry, creamy filling or freshly cut interior.",
  },
  {
    title: "Avoid unnecessary garnish",
    description:
      "Image models often add herbs, berries or decorative ingredients automatically. Explicitly state what garnish is allowed.",
  },
  {
    title: "Match framing to the platform",
    description:
      "A Reel cover needs vertical safe space, while a menu photo or website hero may need a completely different composition.",
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Food Photography Prompt | KRIYANO"
  description="Create realistic AI food photography prompts with precise composition, lighting, styling, texture, camera direction and negative constraints."
>
  <PromptPage
    category="IMAGE GENERATION"
    title="Food Photography"
    accentTitle="Prompt."
    description="Turn a dish description into a detailed food-photography prompt with controlled styling, realistic texture, lighting, camera direction and composition."
    meta={[
      "Free prompt",
      "Image generation",
      "Food photography",
    ]}
    bestFor={[
      "Recipe content",
      "Restaurant visuals",
      "Food advertisements",
      "Social media posts",
      "Reel covers",
      "Menu photography",
    ]}
    masterPrompt={masterPrompt}
    introTitle="Make the food look real, not generated."
    introDescription="Describe the dish accurately first, then control the camera, lighting, styling and negative constraints. The goal is appetizing realism without changing the food itself."
    steps={steps}
    exampleTitle="From dish description to hero food shot."
    example={example}
    tipsTitle="Create more believable food images."
    tips={tips}
    sidebarTitle="Need a different image prompt?"
    sidebarDescription="Use the KRIYANO Prompt Builder to create custom image-generation instructions around your exact subject, style, platform and composition."
    warningTitle="Reference accuracy"
    warningText="When recreating a specific recipe or real dish, check the generated result against the reference. AI models may change ingredients, portion size, layers, garnish or texture unless these details are clearly locked."
  />
</BaseLayout>